cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its research designs, please cite the
  Neural Cryptography project and its author using this metadata.
type: software
title: "Neural Cryptography: Neural-QR, Neural-Corrector and Neural-ZKBoo"
authors:
  - family-names: "Hernandez Ruiz"
    given-names: "Alejandro"
    website: "https://github.com/magnux"
repository-code: "https://github.com/magnux/neural_cryptography"
url: "https://github.com/magnux/neural_cryptography"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research prototypes for neural correction of camera-to-screen optical
  transport and browser-local authentication using a custom ZKBoo-style
  proof of knowledge. Neural-QR is the transport design being developed
  for use with the neural corrector.
keywords:
  - optical communication
  - neural cryptography
  - neural corrector
  - zero-knowledge proofs
